  <body>

    <div>

      <p begin="00:00.130" end="00:03.530" ttm:agent="v1">(Owa-owa) I hit from the back and now she sayin'</p>

      <p begin="00:03.530" end="00:07.350" ttm:agent="v1">(Owa-owa) I hit from the back and now she sayin'</p>

      <p begin="00:07.350" end="00:11.820" ttm:agent="v1">(Owa-owa) I hit from the back, yeah-yeah, oh</p>

      <p begin="00:11.820" end="00:15.370" ttm:agent="v1">(Owa-owa) I hit from the back, yeah-yeah, oh</p>

      <p begin="00:15.370" end="00:17.810" ttm:agent="v1">I got too much to live, no time to forgive</p>

      <p begin="00:17.810" end="00:19.310" ttm:agent="v1">New Chrome, yeah, I got that shit on my hip</p>

      <p begin="00:19.090" end="00:21.060" ttm:agent="v1">You grown, should know I don't got time for this</p>

      <p begin="00:21.060" end="00:22.890" ttm:agent="v1">Alone, you just wanted somebody lit</p>

      <p begin="00:22.890" end="00:24.700" ttm:agent="v1">Might say crazy shit, they think we playin'</p>

      <p begin="00:24.700" end="00:26.560" ttm:agent="v1">A lot in my head, it's just replayin'</p>

      <p begin="00:26.560" end="00:28.540" ttm:agent="v1">Forever, she tellin' me, &quot;Keep sane&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:28.540" end="00:32.840" ttm:agent="v1">I hit from the back and now she sayin' (owa-owa, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:32.840" end="00:36.150" ttm:agent="v1">I roll up the pack and now she sayin' (owa-owa, blatt)</p>

      <p begin="00:36.150" end="00:39.940" ttm:agent="v1">I keep it a stack and now she sayin' (owa-owa, whoo)</p>

      <p begin="00:39.940" end="00:43.590" ttm:agent="v1">Spend it, made it back and now she sayin' (owa-owa, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="00:43.590" end="00:46.540" ttm:agent="v1">Tell her I'll be back and now she sayin', &quot;Nah, nah&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:46.540" end="00:48.310" ttm:agent="v1">Don't gotta go when you on one</p>

      <p begin="00:48.310" end="00:51.770" ttm:agent="v1">Leather seats all in this truck, I ain't came in a coupe, yeah, my legs a lil' taller</p>

      <p begin="00:51.770" end="00:55.720" ttm:agent="v1">Bad Romance, shawty like Lady Gaga, she want a pop star, rock star</p>

      <p begin="00:55.720" end="00:57.430" ttm:agent="v1">I got new hos on my roster, I'm proper</p>

      <p begin="00:57.430" end="00:59.250" ttm:agent="v1">Look through my records, say that you'll cost ya</p>

      <p begin="00:59.250" end="01:02.070" ttm:agent="v1">It's a long time tryna get to Waukesha (owa-owa)</p>

      <p begin="01:02.070" end="01:05.880" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna know what I'm on, already know that you gon' hit me like (owa-owa)</p>

      <p begin="01:05.880" end="01:09.690" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna know when I'm gone, come and touch down in your city like (owa-owa)</p>

      <p begin="01:09.690" end="01:13.490" ttm:agent="v1">Thought of bein' alone, you the one that tryna blow the high (owa-owa, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:13.490" end="01:16.230" ttm:agent="v1">Walk a mile in my sole, prolly won't go home with you beside (yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:16.230" end="01:18.420" ttm:agent="v1">I got too much to live, no time to forgive</p>

      <p begin="01:18.420" end="01:20.180" ttm:agent="v1">New Chrome, yeah, I got that shit on my hip</p>

      <p begin="01:20.180" end="01:22.080" ttm:agent="v1">You grown, should know I don't got time for this</p>

      <p begin="01:22.080" end="01:23.900" ttm:agent="v1">Alone, you just wanted somebody lit</p>

      <p begin="01:23.900" end="01:25.810" ttm:agent="v1">Might say crazy shit, they think we playin'</p>

      <p begin="01:25.810" end="01:27.670" ttm:agent="v1">A lot in my head, it's just replayin'</p>

      <p begin="01:27.670" end="01:29.640" ttm:agent="v1">Forever, she tellin' me, &quot;Keep sane&quot;</p>

      <p begin="01:29.640" end="01:33.060" ttm:agent="v1">I hit from the back and now she sayin' (owa-owa, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:33.060" end="01:37.020" ttm:agent="v1">I roll up the pack and now she sayin' (owa-owa, blatt)</p>

      <p begin="01:37.020" end="01:41.150" ttm:agent="v1">I keep it a stack and now she sayin' (owa-owa, whoo)</p>

      <p begin="01:41.150" end="01:44.460" ttm:agent="v1">Spend it, made it back and now she sayin' (owa-owa, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:44.460" end="01:47.880" ttm:agent="v1">Tell her I'll be back and now she sayin', &quot;Nah, nah&quot;</p>

      <p begin="01:47.880" end="01:51.370" ttm:agent="v1">We told you not to get addicted</p>

      <p begin="01:51.370" end="01:54.170" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh-ooh (nah, nah)</p>

      <p begin="01:54.170" end="01:57.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(We love you, Tecca)</p>

      <p begin="01:57.580" end="02:02.170" ttm:agent="v1">Close your eyes, let it take you</p>

      <p begin="02:02.170" end="02:06.930" ttm:agent="v1">No past, no future</p>

      <p begin="02:06.930" end="02:08.430" ttm:agent="v1">Just now</p>

      <p begin="02:07.410" end="02:11.410" ttm:agent="v1"/>

    </div>

